<title>DENMARK: Danish May unemployment rises to 8.1 percent.</title>
<headline>Danish May unemployment rises to 8.1 percent.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGHEN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's seasonally adjusted unemployment was 8.1 percent of the workforce in May 1997, up from a revised 8.0 percent in April, the National Statistics Office said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
